              "name": "Kristina Hooper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This has WAY WAY WAY too much salt as written.\n\nI significantly reduced the amount of salt, and it was very good. Maybe 1 to 1 1/2 tsp is good. In any case, don't just put 2 Tbsp in there like the recipe says, start small and start it to taste."
