            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chyra Marie Lynch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So good! I took the liberty of pureeing everything and using twice the paneer! I thought the spinach was skimpy, so I added a pound of frozen spinach to my Vitamix, then threw it back in my pan to heat up again. I then added more Indian dried red chili I had in the cupboard. Extra cumin and only salting to taste at the end and serving over Jasmine rice made for a perfect lunch with leftovers.",
            "datePublished": "2019-09-18T21:38:53.323Z"
          },
          {
